    "Is there a requirement that we must ship at least some minimum amount of goods, or is the real goal to ship all available goods using the fewest containers?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single clarification question asking for a policy choice between two mutually exclusive objectives (minimum shipment vs. shipping all goods), which constitutes one independent question."
}

